				A site for Bards with detailed information about all the Bard songs,</font><br><br>
				
				
				<font face="Georgia, Times New Roman, Times, serif" size="2"><a href="http://eqcleric.gameglow.com/">EQ Cleric</a><br>
				A site dedicated to Clerics.</font><br><br>
				
				
				<font face="Georgia, Times New Roman, Times, serif" size="2"><a href="http://enchanter.atomicgamers.com/">The Enchanter's Assembly</a><br>
