				<font face="Georgia, Times New Roman, Times, serif" size="2"><a href="http://sk.eqhq.com/">EQ Shadowknights</a><br>
				A site dedicated to the Shadowknight class.</font><br><br>
				
				
				<font face="Georgia, Times New Roman, Times, serif" size="2"><a href="http://kadanit.com/eqmonks/">Everquest Monks</a><br>
